es, product documentation, and specifications using AI.\n* Building or configuring AI Agents to automate repetitive product workflows.\n* Using AI for analytics, insight generation, competitive research, and decision support.\n* Rapid prototyping of product ideas using AI-assisted tools. \n* Designing AI-native customer experiences, copilots, or conversational interfaces. \n* Evaluating AI solutions with a focus on customer value, safety, scalability, and measurable business outcomes.\n* Experience with tools such as Chat GPT, Claude, Gemini, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, MCP-based tools,or similar AI platforms will be an added advantage.\n\nPreferred Experience\n\n* Experience with one or more of the following is highly preferred.\n* UPI Payments (P2P, P2M, Scan &amp; Pay, Intent, AutoPay, Mandates)\n* Payment Success and Customer Experience Optimization\uf0b7 Consumer Growth and Activation.\n* AI Agents and Agentic Workflows, Prompt Engineering.\n* Personal Finance Products.\n* Wallets and Stored Value Instruments\uf0b7 Digital Banking Knowledge of NPCI guidelines, RBI regulations, payment processing architecture, and digital payment ecosystems will be a strong advantage.\n\nWhy join us: A collaborative output driven program that brings cohesiveness across businesses through technology Improve the average revenue per use by increasing the cross-sell opportunities A solid 360 feedback from your peer teams on your support of their goals. Respect, that is earned, not demanded from your peers and manager\n\nCompensation: If you are the right fit, we believe in creating wealth for you. With enviable 500 mn+ registered users, 21 mn+ merchants and depth of data in our ecosystem, we are in a unique position to democratize credit for deserving consumers & merchants \u2013 and we are committed to it. India\u2019s largest digital lending story is brewing here. It\u2019s your opportunity to be a part of the story!",
