Finance can feel confusing. Broking can feel intimidating.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Our mission is simple:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Make finance clear &amp; easy to understand&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Make wealth creation accessible &amp; provide intelligent insights to power your wealth creation journey&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is where you come in.</p>\n<p>We\u2019re looking for someone who can be the face and voice of modern financial storytelling, someone who is equally comfortable in front of the camera and has a knack for financial research and written &amp; visual storytelling.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This is not just a content role.<br>This is not just a scriptwriting role.<br>This is a video first, creative marketing role.</p>\n<p>You will help us explain broking, trading, investing, fintech, capital markets in a way that builds trust and drives growth.</p>\n<h2><strong>HOW YOU\u2019LL SPEND YOUR TIME</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>50\u201360%: On Camera Content Featuring</strong></h3>\n<p>You will be the on screen personality for share.market trading channel &amp; other avenues.</p>\n<p>You\u2019ll:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Host financial education videos specifically around trading in capital markets</li>\n<li>Present product explainers in a simplified manner<br><br></li>\n<li>Create short-form and long-form content as per the marketing demands</li>\n<li>Build repeatable video series which scales and drives growth</li>\n<li>Continuously improve delivery using performance data<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p>You don\u2019t just \u201cpresent.\u201d<br>You hold attention. You build credibility. You simplify complexity.</p>\n<h3><strong>25\u201330%: Research &amp; Scriptwriting (around trading in capital markets)</strong></h3>\n<p>You\u2019ll:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Research trading, broking, markets, fintech trends</li>\n<li>Write high-retention scripts with strong hooks especially around <strong>trading in capital markets</strong></li>\n<li>Turn complex financial topics into clear simplified stories for user consumption</li>\n<li>Work with product &amp; compliance teams to ensure accuracy. Shape narratives based on platform (YouTube \u2260 Instagram)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>15\u201320%: AI-Powered Content Systems</strong></h3>\n<p>AI is not optional here. It\u2019s core to the role.</p>\n<p>You\u2019ll:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use tools like ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Runway, Midjourney, etc.</li>\n<li>Build prompt libraries for repeatable formats</li>\n<li>Repurpose long-form into short-form using AI</li>\n<li>Test thumbnails, titles and hooks using AI</li>\n<li>Build automated workflows (N8N, Zapier, Make, etc.)</li>\n<li>Identify bottlenecks and design AI solutions<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p>You are not just a user of AI. You build systems with it.</p>\n<h2><strong>WHAT WE\u2019RE LOOKING FOR</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>Strong On-Camera Presence (Critical)</strong></h3>\n<p>You:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Are confident and natural on screen</li>\n<li>Have strong voice control and articulation</li>\n<li>Understand pacing, pauses, hooks for better delivery</li>\n<li>Adapt energy for short-form vs long-form</li>\n<li>Continuously improve using analytics<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p>You don\u2019t try to impress.You make people trust you.</p>\n<h3><strong>Strong Financial Understanding</strong></h3>\n<p>You understand:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Money psychology especially around trading &amp; investing in capital markets</li>\n<li>Stockbroking &amp; capital markets</li>\n<li>Regulatory sensitivity &amp; compliance related to stock broking universe</li>\n<li>Broader fintech &amp; financial ecosystem (cards, insurance, etc.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can simplify without oversimplifying.</p>\n<p><strong>AI-Native Mindset (Critical)</strong></p>\n<p>You:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use LLMs for research &amp; script refinement</li>\n<li>Build reusable AI workflows</li>\n<li>Experiment constantly with new tools</li>\n<li>Think automation-first</li>\n<li>Move fast and iterate<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<p>AI is your operating system.</p>\