      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>WHO ARE WE?</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We are a bunch of super enthusiastic, passionate, and highly driven people, working to achieve a common goal! We believe that work and the workplace should be joyful and always buzzing with energy!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://cloudsek.com/\"><strong>CloudSEK</strong><strong>,</strong></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> one of India\u2019s most trusted Cyber security product companies, is on a mission to build the world\u2019s fastest and most reliable AI technology that identifies and resolves digital threats in real-time. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The central proposition is leveraging Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning to create a quick and reliable analysis and alert system that provides rapid detection across multiple internet sources, precise threat analysis, and prompt resolution with minimal human intervention.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Founded in 2015, headquartered at Singapore, we are proud to say that we\u2019ve grown at a frenetic pace and have been able to achieve some accolades along the way, including:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>CloudSEK\u2019s Product Suite:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CloudSEK </span><strong>XVigil </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">constantly maps a customer\u2019s digital assets, identifies threats and enriches them with cyber intelligence, and then provides workflows to manage and remediate all identified threats including takedown support.</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A powerful Attack Surface Monitoring</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">tool that gives visibility and intelligence on customers\u2019 attack surfaces. CloudSEK's </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>BeVigil </strong></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">uses a combination of Mobile, Web, Network and Encryption Scanners to map and protect known and unknown assets.</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">CloudSEK\u2019s Contextual AI <strong>SVigil</strong> identifies software supply chain risks by monitoring Software, Cloud Services, and third-party dependencies.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Key Milestones:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2016</strong>: Launched our first product.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2018</strong>: Secured Pre-series A funding.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2019</strong>: Expanded operations to India, Southeast Asia, and the Americas.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2020</strong>: Won the NASSCOM-DSCI Excellence Award for Security Product Company of the Year.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2021</strong>: Raised $7M in Series A funding led by MassMutual Ventures.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Awards &amp; Recognition</strong>: Won NetApp Excellerator's \"Best Growth Strategy Award,\" CloudSEK XVigil joined NVIDIA Inception Program, and won the NASSCOM Emerge 50 Cybersecurity Award.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>2025</strong>: Secured $19 million in funding led by Tenacity Ventures, Commvault.</span></li>\n</ul></div><h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"55gtg1\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"17\">Role Overview</h3>\n<p data-start=\"19\" data-end=\"369\">We are hiring an <strong data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"57\">Account Executive</strong> to own new business acquisition and partner-led growth across the Southeast Asia (SEA) region. This is a quota-carrying, revenue-owning role for someone who already understands the SEA cybersecurity buyer landscape and has an existing network of channel and partner relationships they can activate from day one.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"374\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"164ueu3\" data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"400\">Key Responsibilities</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"1483\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1xsf7sg\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"555\">Own and drive the full sales cycle\u2014from prospecting and qualification to demos, negotiation, and closing\u2014for enterprise accounts across the SEA region.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wcofmg\" data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"703\">Build, manage, and grow a network of channel partners, resellers, and system integrators across SEA to expand pipeline and co-sell opportunities.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"d8xbl4\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"831\">Develop and execute a territory plan for SEA, including account segmentation, partner mapping, and pipeline coverage targets.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hwd079\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"909\">Carry and consistently deliver against quarterly and annual revenue quotas.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1v14cgw\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1000\">Represent CloudSEK's product suite to CISOs and security leaders across target accounts.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"111d2w3\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1156\">Collaborate with Security Engineering, Marketing, and Customer Success to build a strong regional pipeline and ensure smooth onboarding of new customers.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11lpjqt\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1231\">Provide accurate forecasting and pipeline reporting to sales leadership.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l1c2vv\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1370\">Stay current on the competitive landscape, threat intelligence market trends, and partner ecosystem dynamics specific to the SEA region.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18c34z7\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1483\">Negotiate contracts and pricing in line with company policy, working closely with Legal and Finance as needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1488\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8b3p4d\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1517\">Required Qualifications</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"2368\">\n<li data-section-id=\"117fs6d\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1558\"><strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1535\">7\u201312 years</strong> of overall experience.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dr56ro\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1704\">Minimum <strong data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1594\">3 years of experience</strong> managing the SEA region in a direct sales or account management role, ideally within a cybersecurity company.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5qxfl\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1862\">Demonstrated experience managing and growing channel and partner relationships across SEA, including resellers, distributors, system integrators, or MSSPs.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"v8v2lw\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1970\">Proven track record of consistently carrying and exceeding a sales quota in a remote or field sales role.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"sky6tp\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2096\">Strong understanding of the SEA enterprise buying process, including public sector and BFSI buying dynamics where relevant.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"srgdlq\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2171\">Excellent communication, negotiation, and executive presentation skills.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4t2pdn\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2233\">Ability to work independently in a remote work environment.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xchk9z\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2368\">Fluency in English is required; proficiency in additional regional languages (Bahasa, Thai, Vietnamese, etc.) is a strong advantage.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2373\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fktgjl\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2403\">Preferred Qualifications</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2769\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1igmllq\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2519\">Prior experience selling Digital Risk Protection, EASM, Threat Intelligence, or related cybersecurity solutions.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uemki4\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2682\">Existing relationships with CISOs and security leaders across key SEA markets, including Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia, the Philippines, Thailand, and Vietnam.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1shpxtk\" data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2769\">Experien