l, sans-serif;\"><strong>What you will own (non-negotiable)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>1. Feature \u2192 Impact \u2192 Revenue Translation</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Every meaningful product update must ship with:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">What changed (in simple language)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Why a CISO / CIO / Head of Risk should care</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Which customer pain it kills</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">How it connects to&nbsp;<strong>Initial Attack Vectors (IAVs)</strong>, exposure reduction, or incident prevention</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">How a GTM rep explains it in&nbsp;<strong>30 seconds</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">If our GTM teams can\u2019t explain it confidently, the job isn\u2019t done.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>2. GTM Training That Actually Sticks</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You will build&nbsp;<strong>short, sharp, repeatable training</strong>, not slideware:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">5\u20137 minute Loom videos</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">\u201cHow to sell this feature\u201d one-pagers</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Objection \u2192 response playbooks</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Deal-specific guidance for Enterprise vs Mid-Market</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You\u2019ll certify reps on&nbsp;<strong>understanding</strong>, not attendance.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>3. Live Coaching &amp; Field Enablement</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">This is not a desk role.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You will:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Join sales and renewal calls</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Coach reps on language, framing, and sequencing</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Run role-plays using&nbsp;<em>real CloudSEK deals</em></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Actively correct weak narratives and unclear positioning</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>4. Tight Feedback Loop with Product</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You are the voice of the field back to product:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">What features confuse customers</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">What value lands vs doesn\u2019t</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">What the market&nbsp;<em>thinks</em>&nbsp;we do vs what we actually do</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Gaps in packaging, pricing, or positioning</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You\u2019ll help ensure we build&nbsp;<strong>sellable intelligence</strong>, not just powerful tech.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>What you will NOT do</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You will not run generic sales training</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You will not create long decks nobody watches</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You will not sit disconnected from real deals</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">You will not measure success by content output alone</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>Success looks like</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Reps confidently explain new features without dragging pre-sales into every call</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif