      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google\u2019s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home d\u00e9cor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world\u2019s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands \u2014 meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">Through Glance AI\u2019s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi\u2019s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.</p></div><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Head of Commercialization&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Location:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;Bay Area (San Mateo, CA)&nbsp;preferred&nbsp;or&nbsp;New York, NY&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What should you know about joining Glance?</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">\u202f</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">At Glance, we walk the talk - free yourself, dream big, and chase your passion! On joining,&nbsp;you'll&nbsp;have opportunities to make an immediate impact on mission-critical projects, as you work with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. Be rewarded for your autonomy even as you collaborate. Ideate, innovate, and inspire by&nbsp;leveraging&nbsp;bleeding-edge tech to disrupt consumer experiences.\u202f</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The ideal candidate is a passionate, self-motivated, and detail-oriented team player who is committed to the success of our customers. You will focus on building strategic 1:1&nbsp;relationships&nbsp;with premium and mid-market retailers in categories like fashion, beauty, and accessories, driving the adoption of Glance\u2019s&nbsp;Agentic&nbsp;Commerce platform in the U.S. retail market.\u202f</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Overview of the role:</strong></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We\u2019re&nbsp;hiring a Head of Commercial Strategy &amp; GTM to build the end-to-end engine that turns Glance AI\u2019s breakthrough AI commerce experiences into durable, predictable revenue in North America. You will sit at the center of Product, Sales, Marketing, and Finance, and own the four disciplines that take a new product from concept to scaled revenue: Commercial Strategy &amp; GTM, Product Marketing &amp; Sales Enablement, Launch &amp; Commercialization (PoC \u2192 MVP \u2192 Launch), and Revenue Operations &amp; Growth\u2014run in close partnership with our India-based&nbsp;RevOps&nbsp;team.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Think of it this way: Strategy defines what we build. You will make it sellable, make it understandable, and make it predictable. If you do the job well, Glance AI will show up in the market with a clear commercial narrative, a disciplined launch motion, and a revenue operating system that compounds with every new product and partnership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:250}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">The impact&nbsp;you\u2019ll&nbsp;make</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:100,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335572079&quot;:6,&quot;335572080&quot;:2,&quot;335572081&quot;:15788258,&quot;469789806&quot;:&quot;single&quot;}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Own commercial strategy &amp; GTM:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Define ICPs, segmentation, and verticalized GTM strategies across enterprise retailers, digital-native brands, and strategic platforms (initial&nbsp;vertical focus: Fashion/Apparel, Beauty, Lifestyle). Build pricing and packaging across media, performance, and platform models; develop&nbsp;the business&nbsp;cases, revenue models, and market sizing that shape where Glance AI invests, what we charge, and how we win.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:30,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Lead Product Marketing &amp; Sales Enablement:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Own positioning and messaging for Glance AI\u2019s AI Commerce platform and its experiences\u2014Agentic Feed, Agentic Chat, Virtual Try-On, and Embed across lock screen, mobile, and CTV. Lead the Product Marketing team and its output: sales decks, case studies, battle cards, one-pagers, and the campaigns that support every launch. Build the sales enablement muscle\u2014training, certifications, and content\u2014that equips every rep to tell our story and win.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:30,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Run the PoC \u2192 MVP \u2192 Launch motion:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Own Glance AI\u2019s commercialization pipeline from first pilot through general availability. Design pilots with design-partner brands, scope MVPs with Product, drive sales readiness, orchestrate cross-functional launches, and build the launch playbooks that let us ship repeatedly at scale. Own post-launch optimization\u2014iterating pricing, positioning, and packaging based on live market&nbsp;signal.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:30,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Make revenue predictable with&nbsp;RevOps:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Partner with our India-based Revenue Operations team to deliver accurate forecasting, disciplined CRM process and hygiene, effective sales comp plan design, healthy pipeline, and the analytics that answer the real questions leadership is asking. Work closely with Rev Ops to translate inputs into commercial decisions\u2014where to pursue, what to price, who to hire, and what to fix.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:30,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Bridge product innovation and revenue:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Act as the connective tissue between Product and Revenue. Translate market and customer feedback into product and roadmap priorities, and ensure every new capability has a clear commercial path before it ships. Close the two critical gaps in most GTM orgs: strategy \u2194 product marketing and product marketing \u2194 launch.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:30,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Enable&nbsp;strategic ecosystem partnerships:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Your efforts will enable our&nbsp;partnerships with commerce platforms, data providers, agencies, and technology ecosystems that accelerate catalog onboarding, merchant adoption, and distribution. Structure co-GTM motions that turn ecosystem relationships into real&nbsp;pipeline.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:30,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">The experience we need:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">12-15+ years across commercial strategy, GTM leadership, product marketing, or revenue operations\u2014with direct experience owning at least two of those functions.</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Proven track record of scaling new products and revenue streams (0\u21921 and beyond) in retail media, commerce, adtech, SaaS, or marketplace platforms. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Deep experience with monetization\u2014pricing, packaging, and revenue models across media, performance, and platform-based products. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Strong product marketing instincts: you can own positioning and messaging yourself, not just hire for it. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Experience running a disciplined launch motion (PoC \u2192 MVP \u2192 Launch) with cross-functional stakeholders, and a track record of repeatable go-to-market execution. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Fluency working with (or in) RevOps\u2014forecasting, pipeline health, CRM process, comp plan design, and funnel analytics\u2014with the ability to partner effectively with a distributed team. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Strong analytical and strategic thinking skills; can move between executive narrative and the numbers that support it. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Comfort operating in ambiguity and defining structure in a new, emerging category.<span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:20,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Preferred Skills</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Experience commercializing AI-driven or&nbsp;personalization-led products.</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Background in first-party data, shopper marketing, or audience monetization. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;335559991&quot;:260,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\">Familiarity with CTV, mobile OEM ecosystems, or other emerging commerce surfaces. </li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"Arial\" data-listid=\"12\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:500,&quot;