t;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Hold the scope line.&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Define and defend what ships at launch versus what follows. Push back \u2014 with data and alternatives \u2014 when scope grows late.</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:7153881,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:273,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Coordinate across functions.&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Bring together Product, Engineering, Design, Revenue Operations, Legal and Privacy, Marketing and PR, and the account team. Turn dependencies into named owners and dates.</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:7153881,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:273,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;\u2022&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Partner with our customers.&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Work alongside the Account Manager as the delivery counterpart to the partner's program and technical teams, driving integration milestones through to launch readiness.</span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\u2022\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335551500&quot;:7153881,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:431,&quot;335559991&quot;:273,&quo