dels</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Experience launching new consumer surfaces or distribution channels in Japan from zero to early scale</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">MBA, ex-consulting, or ex-investment-banking background</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Why Glance AI</strong></span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>A senior seat with real surface area.</strong> You will not be confined to one category or one type of partner. You operate where you can also build a portfolio that is genuinely yours.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Structural backing without big-company friction.</strong>&nbsp;Glance is part of InMobi Group with proven scale (Glance reaches 400M+ monthly users globally) and infrastructure already built, but JP operates as a startup with founding-team latitude on strategy and deals.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>A first-team seat in Japan.</strong>&nbsp;The JP distribution strategy is being written now. The senior IC operating alongside the first Directors helps shape the partner playbook and deal architecture that will be replicated across other markets such as US, Germany, UK, Australia, and Korea in the future.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Real category creation, not incremental work.</strong> Japan's agentic AI distribution layer doesn't exist yet. You are not optimizing a known channel \u2014 you are part of building the playbook that defines how this category reaches Japanese consumers for decades to come.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Competitive salary and benefits:</strong> Base benchmarked against comparable global tech in Tokyo, meaningful equity grant