owth metrics.</li>\n<li><strong>Budget &amp; ROI Management:</strong><br>Own and manage growth budgets, track performance against KPIs, and continuously optimize spend to maximize ROI and business impact.</li>\n<li><strong>Market &amp; Customer Insights:</strong><br>Stay on top of industry trends, competitor strategies, and customer behavior to inform targeting, positioning, promotions, and roadmap priorities.</li>\n<li><strong>Cross-functional Collaboration:</strong><br>Partner closely with Product, Engineering, Design, Analytics, Marketing, Supply, and Business teams to align priorities and execute growth initiatives effectively.</li>\n<li><strong>Reporting &amp; Leadership Communication:</strong><br>Present regular updates on growth performance, insights, and roadmap progress to senior leadership. Define and track OKRs to ensure accountability and impact.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>What is expected out of you?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor\u2019s degree required; MBA or relevant postgraduate degree preferred</li>\n<li>8+ years of experience in a high-growth B2C commerce or e-commerce environment</li>\n<li>Proven track record of driving growth across acquisition, conversion, and retention at scale</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of performance marketing, commerce funnels, pricing, promotions, and user behavior analytics</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience with experimentation frameworks and data-driven decision-making</li>\n<li>Experience working cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, and Marketing teams</li>\n<li>Excellent analytical, communication, and leadership skills</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><span class=\"ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea\">\"<em>Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain persona