      "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.</p>\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"669\">Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google\u2019s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home d\u00e9cor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world\u2019s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands \u2014 meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"1119\">Through Glance AI\u2019s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi\u2019s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.</p></div><p><strong>Senior Motion Graphics Artist, Glance</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Bangalore, India</p>\n<p><strong>Who are we and what do we do?</strong></p>\n<p>Glance is an AI-powered digital content and discovery platform integrated natively onto the smartphone lockscreen. Operating as a subsidiary of the InMobi Group\u2014consistently recognised on both the CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company\u2019s World\u2019s Most Innovative Companies\u2014Glance has fundamentally redefined how digital experiences are consumed. Consistently featured among the \u201cGreat Places to Work\u201d in India, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges, and grow with new opportunities.</p>\n<p>Today, Glance is building an entirely new way to discover and shop. Our commerce experiences are designed to feel personal, visual, and fluid\u2014moving beyond traditional, intent-based search into a world of inspiration-led discovery. Rooted in fashion and expanding into broader lifestyle journeys, the work sits at the precise intersection of systemic product thinking, premium aesthetic taste, and massive engineering scale.</p>\n<p><strong>The Reality of Our Scale:</strong> Glance is a structural market force pre-installed on over 450 million smartphones globally, serving more than 235 million active users who engage with our surfaces natively out of the box. Your design choices will instantly shape one of the largest and most frequent digital footprints in the mobile ecosystem.</p>\n<p><strong>Who will do well in this role?</strong></p>\n<p>This role is for an elite motion designer who understands that movement in a user interface is not decoration\u2014it is meaning. The right individual brings deep kinetic restraint, choreographic rhythm, spatial judgment, and physical intuition. You know exactly how motion can reduce cognitive friction, improve structural orientation, establish system responsiveness, and define the emotional signature of an interface. On an ambient surface like the lockscreen, motion is central to how the product communicates elegance and responsiveness.</p>\n<p><strong>What will you work on?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Architect the Kinetic Signature:</strong> Define, maintain, and elevate the unified motion language, choreographed transitions, and physics engines across Glance\u2019s mobile surfaces. Your work will span everything from micro-interactions and tactile feedback loops to rich, immersive visual narratives.</li>\n<li><strong>Integrate Motion Early:</strong> Partner intimately with UX, Visual Design, Product, and Engineering from the initial ideation phase, ensuring that motion is treated as an architectural foundation of the user journey rather than a cosmetic addition at the end of a sprint.</li>\n<li><strong>Systematise Repeatable Behaviour:</strong> Create reusable, scalable motion principles, interpolation curves, timing guidelines, and asset packages that allow other product teams to scale consistent kinetic behaviour across features and use cases.</li>\n<li><strong>Bridge Concept to Code:</strong> Build high-fidelity interactive prototypes to test real feel and collaborate directly with front-end Android engineers to translate motion paths into production code without loss of visual fidelity.</li>\n<li><strong>Mentor and Inspire:</strong> Guide, structure, and educate junior designers within the studio on the principles of UI motion, framing motion as an instrument of clarity and brand expression.</li>\n<li><strong>Represent the Studio:</strong> Share your insights, workflow methodologies, and Glance\u2019s motion innovation both internally to the larger InMobi organisation and externally within the broader global design community.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Minimum Qualifications</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Motion Product Portfolio:</strong> A collection of work showcasing interactive prototyping, UI animation, kinetic system frameworks, or transition choreographies embedded within shipped software or applications.</