and human-in-the-loop action, or the ability to ramp quickly.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Strong technical instincts around query engines, time-series and trace data, and alerting systems, plus the judgment to know where an AI-assisted experience should replace a manual flow and where depth must stay.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Strong analytical skills and comfort using telemetry, dashboards, SQL, and usage data to understand adoption, friction, reliability, and cost.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Excellent communication across technical and business audiences, and the ability to write clear proposals, decision docs, PRDs, and acceptance criteria.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">High ownership and drive to make progress across a large, ambiguous, fast-moving surface.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Must-Have Qualities</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Runs today, builds tomorrow.</strong> Keeps a live product healthy and competitive while reinventing it, and knows what to sustain and what to rebuild.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Deep observability judgment.</strong> Understands search, metrics, 