obal business demands.</li>\n<li><strong>Continuous Learning:</strong> Stay up to date with emerging technologies and solutions for the modern IT organization.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Skills &amp; Qualifications We Are Looking For</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Experience &amp; Education</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>4+ years of proven professional experience</strong> in IT Helpdesk, IT Support, or IT Operations roles.</li>\n<li>A &nbsp;degree in a Computer Science-oriented field, or equivalent practical experience.</li>\n<li>Strong hands-on experience working with service desk systems, specifically <strong>Freshdesk ITSM</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Technical Expertise</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong laptop and end user applications management skills across multiple operating systems (<strong>Windows, MacOS, Ubuntu Linux</strong>).</li>\n<li>Solid foundational experience with network infrastructure, telecommunications, Audio-Video systems ,Enterprise Mobility Management (EMM) solutions, and Cloud application management.</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience with identity and access management (<strong>SSO, Okta</strong>).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Soft Skills &amp; Mindset</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> An all-around, \"jack-of-all-trades\" capability with a strong desire to work accurately and efficiently.</li>\n<li><strong>Communication:</strong> Excellent verbal and written communication skills to effectively support end-users and train staff.</li>\n<li><strong>Flexibility:</strong> The ability to work independently as well as collaboratively within a global team, adapting to flexible hours when necessary.</li>\n<li><strong>Drive &amp; Passion:</strong> A genuine passion for IT, life, and the Druva product, coupled with the will to have a maximum impact on the company.</li>\n<li><strong>Growth Mindset:</strong> A strong desire to grow yourself, your team, and the organization.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n