, and account management at the global IT Enterprise level.</li>\n<li><strong>Professional Attributes:</strong> Self-driven, proactive, hardworking, and a team-player with a positive disposition.</li>\n<li><strong>Interpersonal Acumen:</strong> Exhibits excellent interpersonal and teamwork skills, with a proven ability to partner with and develop working relationships at all levels, and with multiple internal and external teams and customers.</li>\n<li><strong>Executive Communication:</strong> Ability to effectively communicate with executive/senior management, cross-functional teams, internal customers, external partners, vendors, and end-users.</li>\n<li><strong>Travel Flexibility:</strong> Willingness to travel to other locations and customer sites on occasion.</li>\n<li><strong>Availability:</strong> Preparedness to work outside standard business hours when circumstances necessitate.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>#LI</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h2>Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World's AI Transformation</h2>\n<p>Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/\">Linkedin</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/rubrikinc\">X (formerly Twitter)</a> | <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com\">Rubrik.com</a></p>\n<h2>Inclusion @ Rubrik</h2>\n<p>At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong,