      "description": "<h2><strong>About the team:</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rubrik is redefining data security and needs a highly organized and analytical professional to help scale the work of its global Transformation Office. The Transformation team is supporting Rubrik to be the definitive cyber resilience partner at the center of every global organization's transformation journey. We enable this through deep CXO &amp; boardroom relationships that empower the C-suite with the ability to drive business outcomes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>About the role:</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Build, scale, and govern the infrastructure behind Rubrik's value economics program \u2014 the engine that gives customers clear, data-backed proof of the value of adopting Rubrik.</li>\n<li>Sit at the intersection of technology, analytics, and business strategy, turning the team's AI ambitions into a governed infrastructure customers can rely on for critical investment decisions.</li>\n<li>Work as part of the broader Value Economics team, partnering directly with sales account executives and systems engineers.</li>\n<li>Drive value economics adoption across small and mid-market opportunities by building robust business cases at scale.</li>\n<li>Use Rubrik's existing tools and models as your foundation, with the autonomy to identify the right route to revenue for each unique opportunity.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>What you\u2019ll do?</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Partner with sales account executives and systems engineers to drive value economics adoption across small and mid-market opportunities</li>\n<li>Build compelling business case presentations and ROI analyses that help customers quantify and justify the value of adopting Rubrik.</li>\n<li>Translate complex data into clear, quantifiable benefit narratives and ROI insights for customer-facing business cases</li>\n<li>Establish governance frameworks for data quality, model accuracy, access control, and audit trails to ensure outputs remain accurate and defensible</li>\n<li>Drive and facilitate meetings with Rubrik sales teams to identify, prioritize, and quantify the business value drivers most relevant for each customer</li>\n<li>Work closely with sales to prioritize opportunities based on value-creation potential and deal size.</li>\n<li>Track and report on the realized value of adopted solutions, closing the loop from business case to outcome.</li>\n<li>Continuously support the build and refinement of the AI models and data infrastructure powering the program, ensuring accuracy and consistency at scale.</li>\n<li>Partner with data, AI, IT, product, and sales teams to align infrastructure with business and customer needs</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Experience you'll need:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Engineering, Statistics, or a related quantitative field</li>\n<li>1 year of experience in AI/ML infrastructure, data engineering, or analytics roles, ideally within SaaS, enterprise technology, or value-consulting environments</li>\n<li>Proven experience building and scaling data pipelines, with a strong understanding of infrastructure governance, data quality, and model validation practices</li>\n<li>Familiarity with LLM-based tools and modern AI platforms, along with the judgment to evaluate and integrate new technologies responsibly</li>\n<li>Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate complex data into clear, business-relevant narratives - experience with value/ROI-based analytics or business-case development is a plus</li>\n<li>Excellent cross-functional collaboration skills, with experience partnering across sales, engineering, product, and business teams</li>\n<li>Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to present technical concepts to both technical and executive audiences</li>\n<li>Prior exposure to data protection, cybersecurity, or infrastructure resilience domains (e.g., backup, recovery, cyber resilience) is a strong plus given Rubrik's business contex</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Working Hours: 2 PM to 11 PM IST</h2><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h2>Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World's AI Transformation</h2>\n<p>Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/\">Linkedin</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/rubrikinc\">X (formerly Twitter)</a> | <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com\">Rubrik.com</a></p>\n<h2>Inclusion @ Rubrik</h2>\n<p>At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world\u2019s data.</p>\n<p>Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.</p>\n<h3>Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\">Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.</p>\n</li>\n<li style=