inating a broad internal stakeholder map.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>What You Will Be Doing</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Strategic Leadership</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Define and drive Elastic's EMEA AWS partnership strategy, navigating the coopetitive dynamics of the relationship to deliver joint revenue growth and expand Elastic's presence in the AWS ecosystem.</li>\n<li>Build trusted relationships with AWS and Elastic EMEA senior leadership to ensure shared priorities, executive sponsorship, and sustained momentum.</li>\n<li>Be known as a highly effective and knowledgeable resource for Elastic field teams on co-selling with AWS, value of marketplace, and strategic deal execution.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Marketplace &amp; Revenue Growth</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accelerate AWS Marketplace adoption across EMEA, driving co-sell motions, Marketplace transactions, and partner channel activation.</li>\n<li>Lead key GTM initiatives including competitive displacement campaigns, cloud migration motions, and Elastic's Agentic AI narrative with AWS field teams.</li>\n<li>Manage and maximise AWS SCA funding mechanisms including WMP GTM Fund, PoC Fund, MDF, and MPOPP to fuel field and marketing activities.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Executive &amp; Field Alignment</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Partner closely with EMEA RVPs and AVPs to define priority co-sell accounts and to drive regional co-sell execution.</li>\n<li>Equip EMEA field sellers and SAs with Better Together messaging, competitive positioning and joint sales plays.</li>\n<li>Represent Elastic at priority AWS Summits and joint events including AI BOX programs, CISO roundtables, and partner hackathons.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cross-Functional Orchestration</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Align and partner with the Global AWS Alliance leader to integrate the EMEA Alliance strategy with the existing global strategy.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Work with the Global AWS Marketing Manager and EMEA Partner Marketing M